From 04cb33fa0f2a80abfce1ce0f197b29ca9e549106 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devandroid-bit <180217512+Devandroid-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:19:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] net: sched: enable fq_codel as the default queuing
 discipline

Switch the default qdisc to fq_codel and enable both fq and fq_codel
support in the Exynos9820 defconfig. fq_codel provides per-flow
fair queuing with controlled latency, which noticeably improves
responsiveness under heavy network load on mobile devices.

The default is selected through CONFIG_NET_SCH_DEFAULT and
CONFIG_DEFAULT_FQ_CODEL, so no runtime behaviour changes for
devices that explicitly override the qdisc.

Signed-off-by: Devandroid-bit <180217512+Devandroid-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: @Devandroid-bit.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/exynos9820_defconfig | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9820_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9820_defconfig
index 9b76fd9..00f891f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9820_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9820_defconfig
@@ -1144,13 +1144,14 @@ CONFIG_NET_SCH_NETEM=y
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_CHOKE is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_QFQ is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_CODEL is not set
-# CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ_CODEL is not set
-# CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ is not set
+CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ_CODEL=y
+CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ=y
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_HHF is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_PIE is not set
 CONFIG_NET_SCH_INGRESS=y
 # CONFIG_NET_SCH_PLUG is not set
-# CONFIG_NET_SCH_DEFAULT is not set
+CONFIG_NET_SCH_DEFAULT=y
+CONFIG_DEFAULT_FQ_CODEL=y
 
 #
 # Classification
-- 
